     3175       apply "ctrl-d":U to sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3176     END.
     3177     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date22-3 in menu m-ed-date22 DO:
     3178       apply "ctrl-e":U to sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3179     END.
     3180     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date22-4 in menu m-ed-date22 DO:
