     3606         where  TRUE
     3607          BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-date DESC BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-time DESC
     3608          BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-date DESC BY X_c-obj-hist.corr-time DESC
     3609         indexed-reposition
     3610     .
